  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2002.02 “Approved training organization” means an organization with demonstrated experience in training CHWs that has been approved to offer CHW training, as listed in Plc 2003.03(b).\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
